# DTF tier manifest: sbom-license-expression
#   (artifact-keeper#3866, #4096, #4095; all shipped in 1.11.0)
# Profile-set: filesystem + upstreams.mock-osv + api.swagger.
#   * upstreams.mock-osv: the dependency scanner that runs beside Grype asks a
#     local mock instead of the internet (no answers here; it only keeps the
#     tier offline), and its AK_SSRF_ALLOW_PRIVATE_CIDRS=172.16.0.0/12 admits
#     the self-proxying Remote below.
#   * api.swagger: ENABLE_SWAGGER=true, so /api/v1/openapi.json is served.
#
# Licenses come from the image's bundled Grype: its directory scan catalogs a
# package-lock.json (v3) with each entry's `license` string. The tier stores
# one lockfile in a generic repository (hosted SBOM: POST /api/v1/sbom) and
# ships the same lockfile inside npm tarballs that a scan_on_proxy Remote
# fetches from this backend's own hosted npm repository, addressed by the
# backend's IP on the mock-osv network (proxy SBOM:
# GET /repositories/{key}/security/proxy-sbom).
#
# THE BUGS (all RED on 1.10.0)
#   #3866  A compound SPDX license (`MIT AND PSF-2.0`, `Apache-2.0 WITH
#          LLVM-exception`) was written as CycloneDX `license.name`, which
#          Dependency-Track stores as unresolved free text. Fixed: emitted as
#          `{"expression": ...}`; known single ids stay `license.id`, free text
#          stays `license.name`.
#   #4096  The proxy-cache SBOM always rendered as complete: the inline proxy
#          scan never recorded whether its inventory was whole. Fixed:
#          completeness stored with the verdict (migration 252) and emitted as
#          the CycloneDX `artifact-keeper:scan-completeness` property / SPDX
#          creationInfo comment. A Grype inventory over SCAN_INVENTORY_CAP
#          (10000) is truncated and graded partial, so a tarball whose lockfile
#          lists 10050 packages yields a genuinely partial inline scan.
#   #4095  GET /repositories/{key}/security/proxy-sbom and
#          GET /artifacts/{id}/package-analysis were routed but missing from
#          the OpenAPI document.
#
# THE GATES
#   (CONTROL) every image: single id -> license.id, free text -> license.name
#     (hosted SBOM); the proxy SBOM of a small proxied tarball lists its
#     inventory with no completeness marker; the OpenAPI document is served
#     and lists /api/v1/sbom.
#   (FIX) #3866 x2 (hosted and proxy SBOM), #4096 (CycloneDX and SPDX), #4095:
#     RED on 1.10.0, GREEN on 1.11.0 and later.
#
# NOT GATED: #3866's scanner multi-license join (AND, not OR): Syft keeps only
# one entry of a lockfile license array, so no Grype-cataloged package carries
# two licenses here.
#
# RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=false; UPSTREAM_ALLOW_PRIVATE_IPS=true for the
# self-proxying Remote.
PROFILES="storage.filesystem upstreams.mock-osv api.swagger"
ORACLE="oracle.sh"
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED="false"
UPSTREAM_ALLOW_PRIVATE_IPS="true"
